    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "3980d56b-6b06-4ee7-8561-90c58b41cb8c",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Misfortune Teller",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MARRAKECH",
        "PublicId": "106671394685",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f5ecade6-1a58-44d1-a457-7688746a988d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Marrakesh&apos;s resident fortune teller has fallen on hard times and has used the last of his funds to hire us to make one of his predictions come true. The fortune teller proclaimed that five individuals would die in mysterious accidents in the span of 30 minutes. Eliminate your targets with unique accidents to fulfill his prophecy. One of your targets is the fortune teller himself as the ICA has been contracted by the Rat King of Italy to eliminate him as well.",
